{"id":2638,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp; 为践行社会主义核心价值观，弘扬雷锋精神，引导青年学子投身绿色校园建设，经济与管理学院于3月7日至28日开展“青春绿动，环保同行”雷锋月“校园环保卫士”志愿活动。活动以“清洁校园+光盘行动”为核心，将志愿服务、劳动教育与生态文明建设深度融合，引导经管青年以实际行动践行使命，共建美丽校园。</p><p>“光盘行动”中，同学们响应“拒绝餐饮浪费”号召，按需取餐、文明用餐，践行“光盘”承诺，以行动守护粮食安全、传承勤俭节约美德，彰显青年责任担当。校园清洁环节，志愿者们化身“环保卫士”，身着志愿马甲清理校园公共区域、教学楼周边及非机动车停放区，清除卫生死角、规范车辆停放，展现了新时代经管青年的良好风貌，让雷锋精神落地生根。</p><p>&nbsp; </p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8LR7iiLzAfUlVVLDNCiMzM7MNCsUmGssUzMVUNCbLNMknRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7MSyYLYhfLNn2MRrkL4vinRU8U4LZn7MfUzW2LmT7LNQFM4fkLlW2M4WFMmQ7LRvJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-YMzvbgtA8pUZcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=22579&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CD523A2DF45B375D44C38DCAA2F29D2F/70B1BF72/66D07\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"577\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8LR7iiLzAfUlVVLDNCiMzM7MNCsUmGssUzMVUNCbLNMknRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7MSyYLYhfLNn2MRrkL4vinRU8U4LZn7MfUzW2LmT7LNQFM4fkLlW2M4WFMmQ7LRvJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-YMzvbgtA8pUZcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=22579&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8nRlianz74ozAknDz7bLmA2olUPU4GsZLlLYL4rkMmGDM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfMYy4nkyZU4UiU8M2MNL4o7QVMzrkUmGPM8V2Mz-inmQFLmNaL4-bMRWFMl-bL7-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-YMzvbgtA8pUZcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=22579&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1A73D8C45CCF6C38FE55BB017AF525F6/29032942/5B90B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"577\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8nRlianz74ozAknDz7bLmA2olUPU4GsZLlLYL4rkMmGDM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfMYy4nkyZU4UiU8M2MNL4o7QVMzrkUmGPM8V2Mz-inmQFLmNaL4-bMRWFMl-bL7-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-YMzvbgtA8pUZcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=22579&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;此次活动是学院深化立德树人、推进校园精神文明建设的重要实践，将雷锋精神与环保、劳动教育有机结合，增强了学子的社会责任感与生态文明意识，让志愿精神深入人心，推动节约环保成为校园新风尚。未来，我院将持续以雷锋精神为引领，丰富实践育人形式，引导经管青年传承雷锋精神、助力绿色发展，为校园建设和学校高水平发展注入青春力量。<br></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8LR7iiLzAfUlVVLDNCiMzM7MNCsUmGssUzMVUNCbLNMknRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7MSyYLYhfLNn2MRrkL4vinRU8U4LZn7MfUzW2LmT7LNQFM4fkLlW2M4WFMmQ7LRvJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-YMzvbgtA8pUZcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=22579&e=.png"}